---
import { WHATSAPP_NUMBER } from '../../data/contact';

interface Props {
  whatsappNumber?: string;
}

const { whatsappNumber = WHATSAPP_NUMBER } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="bg-white py-16 px-6 md:px-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200/90 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[#0b1424] text-white p-8 sm:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight">
            Baca & Akses Pembelajaran Di Perpustakaan Digital
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Dapatkan modul cetak maupun e-book digital resmi yang mudah dipelajari kapan saja dan dari mana saja.
          </p>

          <div class="my-8 flex justify-center items-end gap-3 sm:gap-4 py-4">
            <div class="w-24 sm:w-28 h-36 sm:h-40 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-amber-600 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 transform -rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-900 bg-white/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded w-fit">PAKET A</span>
              <div class="space-y-1">
                <div class="w-full h-1 bg-slate-900/20 rounded"></div>
                <div class="w-3/4 h-1 bg-slate-900/20 rounded"></div>
                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-950 mt-1">Dasar</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="w-24 sm:w-28 h-40 sm:h-44 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-500 to-blue-700 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/20 transform translate-y-[-8px] hover:translate-y-[-14px] transition-transform">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-white bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded w-fit">PAKET B</span>
              <div class="space-y-1">
                <div class="w-full h-1 bg-white/30 rounded"></div>
                <div class="w-3/4 h-1 bg-white/30 rounded"></div>
                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-white mt-1">Menengah</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="w-24 sm:w-28 h-36 sm:h-40 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-600 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 transform rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-900 bg-white/70 px-2 py-0.5 rounded w-fit">PAKET C</span>
              <div class="space-y-1">
                <div class="w-full h-1 bg-slate-900/20 rounded"></div>
                <div class="w-3/4 h-1 bg-slate-900/20 rounded"></div>
                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-950 mt-1">Lanjutan</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
            Kemudahan Belajar Bersama PKBM 
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Tidak ada kata terlambat untuk menuntut ilmu. Kami menyederhanakan seluruh alur administrasi agar Anda bisa fokus belajar dengan tenang dan meraih masa depan yang lebih cerah.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✓
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Bebas Biaya Pendaftaran Awal</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Konsultasi dan asesmen gratis.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✓
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Waktu Belajar Fleksibel</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Tersedia kelas daring (online) penuh.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✓
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Didampingi Tutor Ahli</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Bimbingan intensif hingga kelulusan.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-xs">
                ✓
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Ijazah Resmi Akreditasi A</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Legalitas penuh untuk masa depan.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${whatsappNumber}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 active:scale-95 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 transition-all"
          >
            (ini harusnya yang ke web perpustakaan)
          </a>
          <a
            href="/program"
            class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:text-amber-600 px-4 py-3 transition"
          >
            Pelajari Syarat & Ketentuan &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
